('flame-flame-eu-coliseum-2026','flame-flame-fruit-coliseum-eu-2026','onepiece','2026 Flame-Flame Fruit Coliseum EU — Finals','2026-09-04','Bandai Card Games Fest','Europe','OP17 · Flame-Flame Fruit Coliseum',NULL,0,'Flame-Flame Fruit Coliseum EU Grand Finals video','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WlnAznh3Mpc&t=1102s');
